  <h2>Week 1 — Kickoff</h2>
  <p>
    An initial meeting to align business goals, technical scope and success criteria. We define
    the primary communication channel (Slack or Microsoft Teams) and share the detailed work plan.
  </p>

  <h2>Weeks 2-3 — Discovery and architecture</h2>
  <p>
    Technical requirements gathering, architecture and stack definition. We deliver an
    architecture document for review and approval before development begins.
  </p>

  <h2>Communication channels</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A dedicated Slack/Teams channel for the project.</li>
    <li>Weekly 30-minute follow-up meeting.</li>
    <li>A shared task board (Jira or Linear, based on client preference).</li>
  </ul>
</SimpleContentLayout>
